"markdown": "### NeoFreeBird\n\nA powerful tweak for the X (Twitter) app, completely overhauling your user experience with options to restore the classic Twitter interface, block ads, download media, and enhance privacy.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
