{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Classic UI Restoration:** Replaces the \"X\" branding back to \"Twitter\", restores the traditional blue Twitter icon, and customizes dark themes.\n- **Ad Blocking & Feed Cleanup:** Completely removes sponsored posts, hides clutter like Trends and Who to Follow.\n- **High-Quality Media Downloads:** Directly download videos, GIFs, and voice messages in the highest available resolution.\n- **Smart Interactions:** Adds confirmation prompts before posting/liking, quick information copying, and precise engagement metrics.\n- **Security & Utilities:** Lock the Twitter app with Face ID/Touch ID, disable search history, and smart external link handling.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
